  "outstanding": [
    "The scalar modular reduction bounds all imaginary parts below and all their ratios. Its infinite tail is controlled by the separate weighted theta and Eisenstein estimates. Compact lifting for a nonsingular Gram tuple is used in its two-column case. The comparison of arithmetic fundamental domains with the global density constants belongs to the later mass argument."
  ]
